From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:23:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] ASoC: apple: macaudio: Add K116

The K116s (16-inch M5 Pro OLED) has the J714s's audio: six SN012776 amps
in two woofer pairs and two tweeters, the same slots, frame and V/I sense
layout, and the CS42L84 jack codec, so it shares macaudio_j714_cfg under
its own chassis compatible.

Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
[thomas: keep apple,k116-macaudio sorted in the binding]
Signed-off-by: Thomas Glanzmann <thomas@glanzmann.de>
---
omarchy-m5p-oled note (not part of the upstream commit):
Source: aurora-silicon/linux commit 45f4de446485d04741fb2b78f3e952e94db1d0b0, pull request 1648
(merged 2026-11-14), unchanged. Tested upstream on a K116s by its author.
Why here: the K114 entry in patch 0004 goes next to this one, and the K116s is the board the
K114s sound description is ported from. Not needed for the K114s to make sound.

 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 1 +
 sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c                                  | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index 65601dace..37956f0a3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -55,6 +55,7 @@ properties:
               - apple,j813-macaudio
               - apple,j815-macaudio
               - apple,j873-macaudio
+              - apple,k116-macaudio
           - const: apple,macaudio
       - description:
           Machines that share the speaker and jack layout of an earlier
diff --git a/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c b/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
index 096be117d..5fe613124 100644
--- a/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
+++ b/sound/soc/apple/macaudio.c
@@ -4411,6 +4411,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id macaudio_snd_device_id[]  = {
 	{ .compatible = "apple,j700-macaudio", .data = &macaudio_j700_cfg },
 	/* j714    -       sn012776    15      2x 2W+1T (AOP-fed, V/I sense) */
 	{ .compatible = "apple,j714-macaudio", .data = &macaudio_j714_cfg },
+	/* k116    -       sn012776    15      2x 2W+1T (AOP-fed, V/I sense; the 16" PROLED chassis, J714's amps and frame) */
+	{ .compatible = "apple,k116-macaudio", .data = &macaudio_j714_cfg },
 	/* j713    -       sn012776    15      2x 1W+1T (AOP-fed, one serializer) */
 	{ .compatible = "apple,j713-macaudio", .data = &macaudio_j713_cfg },
 	/* The J713 jack runs on the AOP like the J616s one. */
